 data-cstd-page-hero-artifacts=\"true\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 overflow-hidden\"><div data-cstd-deep-artifact=\"neon\" class=\"cstd-deep-neon-rig\"><span class=\"cstd-deep-neon-index\">CSTD / TRACE 09</span><span class=\"cstd-deep-neon-coordinate\">-33.8688 / 151.2093</span><span class=\"cstd-deep-neon-signal\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class=\"cstd-deep-neon-lock\">SIGNAL LOCKED</span></div><div data-cstd-deep-artifact=\"underworld\" class=\"cstd-deep-underworld-stele\"><span class=\"cstd-deep-underworld-kicker\">UNDERWORLD ARCHIVE / FORGE 017</span><span class=\"cstd-deep-underworld-seal\"><i></i><i></i><b>V</b></span><span class=\"cstd-deep-underworld-oath\">TRIED BELOW · RETURNED WHOLE</span><span class=\"cstd-deep-underworld-cuts\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span></div><div data-cstd-deep-artifact=\"astral\" class=\"cstd-deep-astral-compass\"><span class=\"cstd-deep-astral-kicker\">ASTRAL JOURNAL / ROLL 017</span><span class=\"cstd-deep-astral-die\"><i></i><b>20</b><i></i></span><span class=\"cstd-deep-astral-route\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class=\"cstd-deep-astral-oath\">CHOICE INKED · LEGACY CARRIED</span></div></div><div data-cstd-page-hero-content=\"true\" class=\"relative mx-auto flex w-full max-w-[1540px] flex-col justify-end px-5 pb-16 pt-28 md:px-10 lg:px-16 lg:pb-20\"><div class=\"max-w-5xl\"><p data-cstd-page-hero-eyebrow=\"true\" class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#f4d431]\">CURATED PATH / 02</p><h1 data-cstd-page-hero-title=\"true\" class=\"mt-6 text-balance text-[2.375rem] font-semibold leading-[0.94] tracking-[0] text-white sm:text-5xl md:text-7xl md:leading-[0.9] lg:text-8xl xl:text-[7rem]\">Evidence-first AI</h1><p data-cstd-page-hero-summary=\"true\" class=\"mt-7 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8 text-[#c3c9cb] md:text-xl md:leading-9\">Models synthesize; evidence, versions, and deterministic cores constrain.</p></div><div data-cstd-page-hero-scroll=\"true\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-9 flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#748187]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-down h-3.5 w-3.5 animate-bounce text-[#f4d431]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 5v14\"></path><path d=\"m19 12-7 7-7-7\"></path></svg> <!-- -->SCROLL / CONTINUE TRACE</div></div></header><section class=\"border-b border-white/12 bg-[#f1eee5] px-5 py-14 text-[#090b0d] md:px-10 lg:px-16 lg:py-20\"><div class=\"mx-auto grid max-w-[1320px] gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[14rem_minmax(0,1fr)]\"><a class=\"inline-flex h-fit items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#0b6473] hover:text-black\" href=\"/en/topics\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-left h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m12 19-7-7 7-7\"></path><path d=\"M19 12H5\"></path></svg> <!-- -->All topics</a><p class=\"max-w-4xl text-2xl font-semibold leading-10 md:text-4xl md:leading-tight\">Connect research agents, asynchronous jobs, citations, and stale-write protection into one auditable path.</p></div></section><nav data-cstd-topic-path=\"true\" aria-label=\"Continuous judgment path\" class=\"border-b border-white/12 bg-[#07090b] px-5 py-7 md:px-10 lg:px-16\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1320px]\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-5 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#718087]\"><span>CONTINUOUS JUDGMENT PATH</span><span>02<!-- --> / <!-- -->05</span></div><ol class=\"mt-4 grid gap-1 sm:grid-cols-5\"><li><a class=\"group block border-t border-white/15 pt-3 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#6f7b80] transition-colors hover:border-[#24e0ff] hover:text-white aria-[current=step]:border-[#f4d431] aria-[current=step]:text-[#f4d431]\" href=\"/en/topics/system-boundaries\"><span class=\"mr-2\">01</span>System boundaries and runtime ownership</a></li><li><a aria-current=\"step\" class=\"group block border-t border-white/15 pt-3 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#6f7b80] transition-colors hover:border-[#24e0ff] hover:text-white aria-[current=step]:border-[#f4d431] aria-[current=step]:text-[#f4d431]\" href=\"/en/topics/evidence-first-ai\"><span class=\"mr-2\">02</span>Evidence-first AI</a></li><li><a class=\"group block border-t border-white/15 pt-3 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#6f7b80] transition-colors hover:border-[#24e0ff] hover:text-white aria-[current=step]:border-[#f4d431] aria-[current=step]:text-[#f4d431]\" href=\"/en/topics/quantitative-systems\"><span class=\"mr-2\">03</span>Quantitative research systems</a></li><li><a class=\"group block border-t border-white/15 pt-3 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#6f7b80] transition-colors hover:border-[#24e0ff] hover:text-white aria-[current=step]:border-[#f4d431] aria-[current=step]:text-[#f4d431]\" href=\"/en/topics/visual-computing\"><span class=\"mr-2\">04</span>Browser visual computing</a></li><li><a class=\"group block border-t border-white/15 pt-3 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#6f7b80] transition-colors hover:border-[#24e0ff] hover:text-white aria-[current=step]:border-[#f4d431] aria-[current=step]:text-[#f4d431]\" href=\"/en/topics/interdisciplinary-engineering\"><span class=\"mr-2\">05</span>Interdisciplinary engineering path</a></li></ol></div></nav><section class=\"border-b border-white/12 bg-[#080a0c] px-5 py-16 md:px-10 lg:px-16 lg:py-20\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1320px]\"><h2 class=\"flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] font-black uppercase\" style=\"color:#ff5a50\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-layers h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12.83 2.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 6.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.83l8.58 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0l8.58-3.9a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.83z\"></path><path d=\"M2 12a1 1 0 0 0 .58.91l8.6 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.65 0l8.58-3.9A1 1 0 0 0 22 12\"></path><path d=\"M2 17a1 1 0 0 0 .58.91l8.6 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.65 0l8.58-3.9A1 1 0 0 0 22 17\"></path></svg> <!-- -->Shipped systems</h2><div class=\"mt-7 border-t border-white/15\"><a class=\"group grid gap-4 border-b border-white/15 py-7 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-3 focus-visible:outline-[#24e0ff] md:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.72fr)_minmax(20rem,1.28fr)_auto] md:items-center md:gap-8\" href=\"/en/work/alpha-research-system\"><div><p class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#738086]\">EVIDENCE PIPELINE / DECISION WORKSPACE</p><h3 class=\"mt-3 text-2xl font-semibold text-white md:text-3xl\">CSTD Alpha research system</h3></div><p class=\"text-sm leading-7 text-[#96a2a6]\">A research workflow instead of a one-shot report: sources, background jobs, valuation versions, and disconfirming conditions stay with each result.</p><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#f4d431] transition-[gap,color] group-hover:gap-4 group-hover:text-white\">Open evidence<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></span></a><a class=\"group grid gap-4 border-b border-white/15 py-7 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-3 focus-visible:outline-[#24e0ff] md:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.72fr)_minmax(20rem,1.28fr)_auto] md:items-center md:gap-8\" href=\"/en/work/creative-workbench\"><div><p class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#738086]\">GENERATIVE MEDIA / PRIVATE WORKFLOW</p><h3 class=\"mt-3 text-2xl font-semibold text-white md:text-3xl\">CSTD Design creative workbench</h3></div><p class=\"text-sm leading-7 text-[#96a2a6]\">A private Chinese workbench where conversations branch, image and video jobs can recover, and every asset keeps its source.</p><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#f4d431] transition-[gap,color] group-hover:gap-4 group-hover:text-white\">Open evidence<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></span></a></div></div></section><section class=\"border-b border-white/12 bg-[#080a0c] px-5 py-16 md:px-10 lg:px-16 lg:py-20\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1320px]\"><h2 class=\"flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] font-black uppercase\" style=\"color:#24e0ff\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-book-open h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 5v16\"></path><path d=\"M20.001 19A2 2 0 0022 17V5a2 2 0 00-1.999-2L16 3.002A5 5 0 0012 5a5 5 0 00-4-2H4a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 001.999 2H8a5 5 0 014 2 5 5 0 014-2z\"></path></svg> <!-- -->Engineering notes</h2><div class=\"mt-7 border-t border-white/15\"><a class=\"group grid gap-4 border-b border-white/15 py-7 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-3 focus-visible:outline-[#24e0ff] md:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.72fr)_minmax(20rem,1.28fr)_auto] md:items-center md:gap-8\" href=\"/en/notes/evidence-first-ai-research\"><div><p class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#738086]\">AI SYSTEMS / 13 MIN</p><h3 class=\"mt-3 text-2xl font-semibold text-white md:text-3xl\">Refresh evidence before asking the model to speak</h3></div><p class=\"text-sm leading-7 text-[#96a2a6]\">In company research, stale facts, duplicate jobs, and conclusions without a clear source usually cost more than tokens.</p><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#f4d431] transition-[gap,color] group-hover:gap-4 group-hover:text-white\">Open evidence<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></span></a><a class=\"group grid gap-4 border-b border-white/15 py-7 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-3 focus-visible:outline-[#24e0ff] md:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.72fr)_minmax(20rem,1.28fr)_auto] md:items-center md:gap-8\" href=\"/en/notes/deterministic-core-ai-edge\"><div><p class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#738086]\">PRODUCT ENGINEERING / 12 MIN</p><h3 class=\"mt-3 text-2xl font-semibold text-white md:text-3xl\">Put AI at the explanation edge, not the decision core</h3></div><p class=\"text-sm leading-7 text-[#96a2a6]\">Let AI organize and explain while testable code keeps authority over valuation formulas, cash flow, discounting, and versions.</p><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#f4d431] transition-[gap,color] group-hover:gap-4 group-hover:text-white\">Open evidence<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></span></a></div></div></section><section class=\"border-b border-white/12 bg-[#080a0c] px-5 py-16 md:px-10 lg:px-16 lg:py-20\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1320px]\"><h2 class=\"flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] font-black uppercase\" style=\"color:#3dff8f\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-flask-conical h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 .245.96l5.51 10.08A2 2 0 0 1 18 22H6a2 2 0 0 1-1.755-2.96l5.51-10.08A2 2 0 0 0 10 8V2\"></path><path d=\"M6.453 15h11.094\"></path><path d=\"M8.5 2h7\"></path></svg> <!-- -->Executable labs</h2><div class=\"mt-7 border-t border-white/15\"><a class=\"group grid gap-4 border-b border-white/15 py-7 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-3 focus-visible:outline-[#24e0ff] md:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.72fr)_minmax(20rem,1.28fr)_auto] md:items-center md:gap-8\" href=\"/en/lab/agent-replay\"><div><p class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#738086]\">LAB 02 / 1.1.0</p><h3 class=\"mt-3 text-2xl font-semibold text-white md:text-3xl\">Agent Replay</h3></div><p class=\"text-sm leading-7 text-[#96a2a6]\">A stale job may finish, but it cannot overwrite current truth.</p><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#f4d431] transition-[gap,color] group-hover:gap-4 group-hover:text-white\">Open evidence<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></span></a><a class=\"group grid gap-4 border-b border-white/15 py-7 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-3 focus-visible:outline-[#24e0ff] md:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.72fr)_minmax(20rem,1.28fr)_auto] md:items-center md:gap-8\" href=\"/en/lab/proof-museum\"><div><p class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#738086]\">LAB 05 / 1.0.0</p><h3 class=\"mt-3 text-2xl font-semibold text-white md:text-3xl\">Proof Museum</h3></div><p class=\"text-sm leading-7 text-[#96a2a6]\">The strongest way to present engineering ability is to make its critical boundaries runnable again.</p><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#f4d431] transition-[gap,color] group-hover:gap-4 group-hover:text-white\">Open evidence<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></span></a></div></div></section><a class=\"group relative block min-h-[28rem] overflow-hidden border-b border-white/12 px-5 py-16 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-inset focus-visible:outline-[#f4d431] md:px-10 lg:px-16\" href=\"/en/topics/quantitative-systems\"><img alt=\"A continuous reading path through the quiet knowledge archive\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover object-[44%_50%] opacity-55 transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-[1.025]\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/cstd-universe/cstd-quiet-archive-v4.webp\"/><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(5,7,9,0.98),rgba(5,7,9,0.78)_55%,rgba(5,7,9,0.25))]\"></div><div class=\"relative mx-auto flex min-h-[20rem] max-w-[1320px] items-end justify-between gap-8\"><div><p class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#3dff8f]\">NEXT PATH<!-- --> / <!-- -->03</p><p class=\"mt-5 max-w-4xl text-4xl font-semibold leading-tight text-white md:text-6xl\">Quantitative research systems</p><p class=\"mt-5 max-w-2xl text-base leading-8 text-[#b8c1c4]\">Make assumptions interactive, formulas reproducible, and performance evidence observable.</p></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-9 w-9 shrink-0 text-[#f4d431] transition-transform group-hover:-translate-y-2 group-hover:translate-x-2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></div></a></main><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"LearningResource\",\"name\":\"Evidence-first AI\",\"description\":\"Connect research agents, asynchronous jobs, citations, and stale-write protection into one auditable path.\",\"url\":\"https://custard.top/en/topics/evidence-first-ai\",\"hasPart\":[{\"@type\":\"CreativeWork\",\"name\":\"CSTD Alpha research system\",\"url\":\"https://custard.top/en/work/alpha-research-system\"},{\"@type\":\"CreativeWork\",\"name\":\"CSTD Design creative workbench\",\"url\":\"https://custard.top/en/work/creative-workbench\"},{\"@type\":\"TechArticle\",\"name\":\"Refresh evidence before asking the model to speak\",\"url\":\"https://custard.top/en/notes/evidence-first-ai-research\"},{\"@type\":\"TechArticle\",\"name\":\"Put AI at the explanation edge, not the decision core\",\"url\":\"https://custard.top/en/notes/deterministic-core-ai-edge\"}]}</script></div><footer class=\"relative z-10 border-t border-white/12 bg-[#050709]/90 px-5 py-12 md:px-10 lg:px-16\"><div class=\"mx-auto grid max-w-[154